OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud and
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells. A few
OL,7,Fshowers across the west, but mainly
OL,8,Fdry across the east. Brisk
OL,9,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FAny showers gradually dying
OL,12,Fout this evening. Then the rest of the
OL,13,Fnight will be dry with variable
OL,14,Famounts of cloud. Brisk southwesterly
OL,15,Fwinds easing later.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FWidespread rain, occasionally
OL,18,Fheavy, will spread northeast during
OL,19,Fthe morning. Drier and clearer weather
OL,20,Fwill spread from the west by evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
